cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use anatomapa in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: anatomapa
abstract: >-
  Python library for generating anatomical heatmaps of the human body surface, in anterior
  and posterior views, coloring regions by frequency, intensity or density of events. Zero
  external dependencies and deterministic output.
type: software
